WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.153
Hope hurried over to Robot.

2
00:00:08.154 --> 00:00:10.504
"Sorry, Robot!" she said.

3
00:00:10.505 --> 00:00:13.918
"We didn't mean to leave you behind."

4
00:00:13.919 --> 00:00:19.272
Robot was still pointing at the kneeling man.

5
00:00:19.273 --> 00:00:22.062
Hope looked where Robot was pointing.

6
00:00:22.063 --> 00:00:25.289
There was a man in a brown coat.

7
00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.945
He was picking up some art supplies.

8
00:00:27.946 --> 00:00:30.986
They were lying on the floor.

9
00:00:30.987 --> 00:00:33.276
Hope and Dad went over to him.

10
00:00:33.277 --> 00:00:37.036
"We can help you pick up this stuff," Hope said.

11
00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:42.084
She began picking up pens and pencils.

12
00:00:42.085 --> 00:00:46.614
Now Robot could see the man's face.

13
00:00:46.615 --> 00:00:52.787
"It's Dan Klee!" Robot thought.

14
00:00:52.788 --> 00:00:57.728
Hope was looking closely at the man too.

15
00:00:57.729 --> 00:01:01.207
"Are you Dan Klee?" she asked.

16
00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:03.810
"You draw MechaTron, right?"

17
00:01:03.811 --> 00:01:06.555
Robot gulped.

18
00:01:06.556 --> 00:01:10.499
What if Dan was as mean as the actor?

19
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.221
Dan smiled. "Yes."

20
00:01:14.222 --> 00:01:18.374
Hope beamed. "I love MechaTron comics!

21
00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:20.743
My favorite is the sea monster one."

22
00:01:20.744 --> 00:01:23.152
Dan reached into his bag.

23
00:01:23.153 --> 00:01:25.895
"Would you like a signed MechaTron drawing?"

24
00:01:25.896 --> 00:01:30.987
"That would be amazing!" Hope said.

25
00:01:30.988 --> 00:01:38.799
Dan gave her one.

26
00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:42.986
Robot looked at the drawing.

27
00:01:42.987 --> 00:01:47.028
"The human actor might be mean," Robot thought.

28
00:01:47.029 --> 00:01:49.941
"But the robot is still awesome.

29
00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:53.255
And so is Dan Klee."

30
00:01:53.256 --> 00:01:56.756
"Is this your robot?" Dan asked.

31
00:01:56.757 --> 00:02:01.052
"He's asking about me!" Robot thought.

32
00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:05.110
"Yes," Hope said. "We go on secret missions together.

33
00:02:05.111 --> 00:02:08.691
I plan them, and Robot uses his special skills."

34
00:02:08.692 --> 00:02:13.514
Dan listened carefully. "Hmm. Interesting . . ."

35
00:02:13.515 --> 00:02:17.697
"We have so much fun together," Hope said.

36
00:02:17.698 --> 00:02:20.124
Dan whispered something to Hope.

37
00:02:20.125 --> 00:02:25.468
Hope gasped. "Yes!"

38
00:02:25.469 --> 00:02:28.586
"What was that about?" Robot thought.

39
00:02:28.587 --> 00:02:32.845
"Whatever Dan said made Hope very happy."

40
00:02:32.846 --> 00:02:36.022
Hope had a big smile on her face.

41
00:02:36.023 --> 00:02:42.156
Robot smiled too.

